=1778529129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funi Raccoon Game</strong>, a 3D Platformer Collectathon. You play as a raccoon who has recently acquired a new home (Dumpster).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/c16ada8c79a880e845e7ed5f5b3b4e44.poster.avif?t=1778529129\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/c16ada8c79a880e845e7ed5f5b3b4e44.webm?t=1778529129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/c16ada8c79a880e845e7ed5f5b3b4e44.mp4?t=1778529129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home is where the stuff is, but your home is pretty empty. Fill up your dumpster with cool, unique stuff.  The more stuff you have, the more places you can go! Travel the lands, &quot;help&quot; the locals, and solve puzzles -- <i><strong>all in the aim to get more stuff!?!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/153e544df3ee55c98fd84f8df47f154b.poster.avif?t=1778529129\" width=400 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/153e544df3ee55c98fd84f8df47f154b.webm?t=1778529129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/153e544df3ee55c98fd84f8df47f154b.mp4?t=1778529129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/5d8ea5f164eab31ccd7b400bf5dcc890.poster.avif?t=1778529129\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/5d8ea5f164eab31ccd7b400bf5dcc890.webm?t=1778529129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/5d8ea5f164eab31ccd7b400bf5dcc890.mp4?t=1778529129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Pick Up</strong></i></u> and <u><i><strong>Throw Stuff</strong></i></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use that <u><strong>stuff</strong></u> for problem solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more <u><strong>stuff</strong></u> you have, the more new areas you unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <u><strong>stuff</strong></u> enables a multitude of traversal possibilities for those willing to seize the keys of opportunity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to various microworlds all interconnected in whimsical ways</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/07941265bae3e6cf0180d1a7c6070d52.poster.avif?t=1778529129\" width=620 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/07941265bae3e6cf0180d1a7c6070d52.webm?t=1778529129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/07941265bae3e6cf0180d1a7c6070d52.mp4?t=1778529129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hi o/</p><p class=\"bb_par